Third party material
--------------------

This product bundles three reference portraits in refs/ (fizz.png, honey.png
and bumble.png). They are derivative works of files from block/buzz:

  https://github.com/block/buzz
  desktop/public/onboarding/starter-team/
  commit 1aab50e950f2b7ef75cc6ec6e6055de681a4bff7 (2026-07-17)

Copyright 2026 Block, Inc., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The originals are full standing figures, 160 pixels wide, on a transparent
background. Each file here was cropped to a square anchored on the head,
composited onto a white background, and resized to 384 by 384 pixels. No
colour, shape or detail was changed. refs/LICENSE carries the same notice and
the full statement of changes, and refs/fetch.sh re-derives the files from the
untouched originals so the provenance can be verified rather than trusted.

These files are redistributed in this repository and are copied into every
install.

