The generated parts
-------------------

This needs saying plainly, because the reference portraits are not the whole
story. The 111 part images under sprites/ were produced by an image model that
was shown those three portraits and asked to work in the same style. They are
new images rather than copies, but they are deliberately in the same visual
family as Block's bee characters, and they would not look the way they do
without them.

So this project does not claim its bees are independent of Block's design. It
claims they are new drawings made in the open, with the influence stated rather
than hidden, for people to give their own agents a face on a platform Block
built.

If Block would prefer this not exist in this form, open an issue on this
repository and it will be taken down or changed. That offer is the point of
writing this paragraph.
